#: ../../legacy/cmucam4/troubleshooting.rst:2
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "疑難排解"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam4/troubleshooting.rst:5
msgid ""
"In Demo Mode the power light, auxiliary light, and TV turn on for a second "
"and then everything stops"
msgstr "在示範模式下，電源燈、輔助燈與電視亮起一秒鐘，然後一切就停止了"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam4/troubleshooting.rst:7
msgid ""
"When both the CMUcam4 and pan and/or tilt servos are active, the power "
"required is greater. Try using a battery or voltage source rated at a higher"
" current."
msgstr "當 CMUcam4 與平移及／或傾斜伺服機都在運作時，所需的電力會更大。試著使用額定電流較高的電池或電壓源。"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam4/troubleshooting.rst:11
msgid "The power LED does not glow or glows dimly"
msgstr "電源 LED 不亮或亮度微弱"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam4/troubleshooting.rst:13
msgid ""
"The board either has a fault, or your power supply is not generating enough "
"power. The power supply should be capable of delivering at least 250 mA at "
"between 4 volts to 9 volts DC. Check the power supply and look over all of "
"the wire connections. Try unplugging all of the wires except for the power "
"wires and turn the CMUcam4 on again."
msgstr ""
"電路板不是有故障，就是您的電源供應器未產生足夠的電力。電源供應器應能在 4 伏特至 9 伏特直流電之間提供至少 250 "
"mA。請檢查電源供應器並仔細查看所有的接線連接。試著拔除除電源線以外的所有接線，然後再次開啟 CMUcam4。"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam4/troubleshooting.rst:20
msgid "I get garbage output from the camera"
msgstr "我從相機得到亂碼輸出"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam4/troubleshooting.rst:22
msgid ""
"Try turning the camera off and unplugging it for 10 seconds. Then plug it "
"back in and try again."
msgstr "試著關閉相機並拔除電源 10 秒。然後再重新插上並再試一次。"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam4/troubleshooting.rst:26
msgid ""
"I get wavy lines in my image or a distorted black and white image when I "
"call \"DF\" (Dump Frame)"
msgstr "當我呼叫「DF」（Dump Frame，傾印畫格）時，我的影像出現波浪狀線條或扭曲的黑白影像"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam4/troubleshooting.rst:28
msgid ""
"This is most likely due to power. Make sure that you have a high enough "
"voltage and that you are getting a clean signal. Running the camera off of "
"fresh batteries (not an AC adapter) is a good way to test if this is the "
"problem. The camera module could also possibly be damaged."
msgstr ""
"這很可能是電源造成的。請確保您有足夠高的電壓，並且您得到的是乾淨的訊號。以新電池（而非 AC "
"變壓器）運行相機，是測試這是否為問題所在的好方法。相機模組也有可能已損壞。"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam4/troubleshooting.rst:34
msgid "My processor can not keep up with the serial data stream"
msgstr "我的處理器無法跟上序列資料串流"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam4/troubleshooting.rst:36
msgid ""
"Try running the camera in poll mode using the \"PM\" (Poll Mode) command and"
" setting a delay mode value using the \"DM\" (Delay Mode) command."
msgstr "試著使用「PM」（Poll Mode）命令讓相機以輪詢模式運行，並使用「DM」（Delay Mode）命令設定一個延遲模式值。"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam4/troubleshooting.rst:40
msgid "I don't seem to get any serial data"
msgstr "我似乎沒有收到任何序列資料"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam4/troubleshooting.rst:42
msgid ""
"Make sure that the serial cable is attached to the CMUcam4 correctly. If in "
"doubt, try reversing it."
msgstr "確保序列傳輸線已正確連接至 CMUcam4。如有疑問，請嘗試將其反接。"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam4/troubleshooting.rst:46
msgid "I see the CMUcam4 startup message, but, then nothing happens"
msgstr "我看到 CMUcam4 的啟動訊息，但接著什麼都沒發生"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam4/troubleshooting.rst:48
msgid ""
"Check to make sure the transmit line on your serial cable is connected "
"correctly."
msgstr "檢查以確保您序列傳輸線上的傳送線已正確連接。"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam4/troubleshooting.rst:51
msgid "My microSD card doesn't work"
msgstr "我的 microSD 卡無法運作"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam4/troubleshooting.rst:53
msgid ""
"MicroSD cards differ based on brand. It is possible that your brand doesn't "
"work with the CMUcam4. It is also possible that your card has a corrupt file"
" system. In this case, try reformatting your card and check to make sure the"
" contacts on your board and card look clean."
msgstr ""
"MicroSD 卡因品牌而異。您的品牌有可能無法與 CMUcam4 "
"搭配使用。也有可能是您的卡片檔案系統已損毀。在這種情況下，請嘗試重新格式化您的卡片，並檢查以確保您電路板與卡片上的接點看起來乾淨。"
